<paragraphs><title>Allowed But Insufficient: Four-Function (Basic) Calculators</title></paragraphs>
<p>A four-function calculator may actually have four, five, or six basic functions. They are limited to addition, subtraction, multiplication, division, square roots, and percentage.</p>

